  "name": {
   "zh": "深度贴图 · Video Depth Anything",
   "en": "Depth Map · Video Depth Anything"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Video Depth Anything 官方自述：基于 Depth Anything V2，任意长度的视频都能算，质量、一致性和泛化能力不打折，比扩散模型更快。这张卡交付整段时序一致的深度贴图：「真实」模型给厘米深度，「相对」模型给相对视差。模型选 Base / Large 时按非商用算。",
   "en": "Video Depth Anything describes itself as built on Depth Anything V2, handling videos of any length without losing quality, consistency or generalization, and faster than diffusion models. This card delivers temporally consistent depth maps for the whole shot: Metric models give depth in centimeters, Relative models give relative disparity. With Model set to Base / Large, the card counts as non-commercial."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
